<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLBA0C9F06006">Steering Switch (Audio Control Switch and Hands-Free Switch) Removal and Installation</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove driver air bag (inflator) module. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C8206005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect steering switch connector.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Measure resistance between the following terminals under each condition in the table.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check for continuity between connectors [A] and [B].
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Set tester at diode range when measuring between terminals 3 and 9, 3 and 14, 9 and 15, 14 and 15.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
If check result is not as specified, replace audio control switch.
</ptxt>
